WEBVTT

00:00:34.730 --> 00:00:37.776
[narrator] Legend tells
of a legendary warrior...
传说中有一名传奇武林高手

00:00:37.907 --> 00:00:41.476
...whose kung fu skills
were the stuff of legend.
他的武艺早已成为传说

00:00:41.606 --> 00:00:47.395
He traveled the land
in search of worthy foes.
他在江湖四处流浪 寻找对手

00:00:47.525 --> 00:00:49.919
[laughter,
indistinct chattering]

00:00:50.789 --> 00:00:53.314
[whimpering]

00:00:57.231 --> 00:01:02.192
I see you like to chew. Maybe
you should chew on my fist!
你好像很爱吃哦
你不如吃我一拳吧

00:01:02.323 --> 00:01:06.283
The warrior said nothing,
for his mouth was full.
大侠在吃东西 所以没回话

00:01:06.414 --> 00:01:09.765
Then he swallowed.
And then he spoke.
他终于吞下食物
然后说…

00:01:09.895 --> 00:01:11.984
Enough talk.
Let's fight!
废话少说 放马过来！

00:01:12.115 --> 00:01:13.725
Shashabooey!
我杀杀杀！

00:01:16.511 --> 00:01:18.295
He was so deadly, in fact,
他的杀气太重…

00:01:18.426 --> 00:01:20.558
that his enemies would
go blind from overexposure
对手看到他的英姿就会变瞎

00:01:20.689 --> 00:01:21.951
to pure awesomeness.
对手看到他的英姿就会变瞎

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:24.475
- My eyes!
- He's too awesome!
-我眼睛瞎了！
-他太厉害了！

00:01:24.606 --> 00:01:27.261
- And attractive.
- How can we repay you?
-而且超帅的！
-我们该如何报答你？

00:01:27.391 --> 00:01:30.307
There is no charge
for awesomeness.
行侠仗义…不须回报

00:01:30.438 --> 00:01:33.049
- Or attractiveness.
- [girl giggling]
长得帅气也是…

00:01:33.180 --> 00:01:34.920
Kablooey!

00:01:35.051 --> 00:01:37.009
[narrator] It mattered not
how many foes he faced.
不管他面对多少对手

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:40.404
They were no match
for his bodacity!
对方都抵挡不了他的超凡武艺

00:01:49.283 --> 00:01:50.675
Yah!

00:01:52.721 --> 00:01:57.769
Never before had a panda
been so feared! And so loved.
江湖上从未出现如此
充满杀气的熊猫！而且人气超旺！

00:01:57.900 --> 00:02:00.859
Even the most heroic heroes
in all of China,
就连中国最厉害的武林高手

00:02:00.990 --> 00:02:03.297
the Furious Five,
盖世五侠…

00:02:03.427 --> 00:02:06.343
bowed in respect
to this great master.
都对这名伟大侠士甘拜下风！

00:02:06.474 --> 00:02:09.433
- We should hang out.
- Agreed.
咱们应该一起找乐子

00:02:09.564 --> 00:02:12.044
[all] Yiii!

00:02:12.175 --> 00:02:14.569
[narrator] But hanging out
would have to wait.
不过他们没时间找乐子

00:02:14.699 --> 00:02:18.747
Because when you're facing
the 10,000 demons
of Demon Mountain,
因为一旦面对凶神恶煞

00:02:18.877 --> 00:02:21.967
there's only one thing
that matters and that's...
唯有一件事才是关键
那就是…

00:02:22.098 --> 00:02:23.708
Po! Get up!
阿波！起床！

00:02:23.839 --> 00:02:25.449
You'll be late for work!
快迟到了！

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:27.364
What?
糟糕

00:02:27.495 --> 00:02:29.236
[thumping]

00:02:30.454 --> 00:02:31.673
[yawning]

00:02:33.327 --> 00:02:35.764
[man]
Po! Get up!
阿波！给我起床！

00:02:44.120 --> 00:02:45.774
[sighs]

00:02:47.471 --> 00:02:49.430
[grunting]

00:02:50.909 --> 00:02:53.912
[man] Po. What are
you doing up there?
你在搞什么东西？

00:02:54.043 --> 00:02:55.610
Uh... nothing.
没什么

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.568
[grunting]

00:02:57.699 --> 00:02:59.135
[yells]

00:02:59.266 --> 00:03:02.834
Monkey! Mantis!
Crane! Viper! Tigress!
猴王！快螳螂！
灵鹤！俏小龙！虎妞！

00:03:02.965 --> 00:03:04.140
[roaring]

00:03:04.271 --> 00:03:06.360
Uh...

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:12.757
[man] Po! Let's go!
You're late for work.
阿波！快点！上工了！

00:03:12.888 --> 00:03:14.368
Coming!
我来了啦

00:03:17.806 --> 00:03:21.810
- [grunting]
- [thumping footsteps]

00:03:24.378 --> 00:03:28.686
- Sorry, Dad.
- Sorry doesn't
make the noodles.
对不起又不能当面吃

00:03:28.817 --> 00:03:31.080
What were you doing up there?
All that noise.
你在房间搞什么鬼？

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:33.561
Oh. Nothing.
I just had a crazy dream.
没有呀 只是做了一场梦

00:03:33.691 --> 00:03:34.953
- About what?
- Huh?
什么梦？

00:03:35.084 --> 00:03:36.564
What were you dreaming about?
你做了什么样的梦？

00:03:36.694 --> 00:03:39.001
What was I...? Uh...
我的梦？

00:03:39.131 --> 00:03:41.221
I was dreaming about...
我梦到…

00:03:41.699 --> 00:03:42.831
...uh...

00:03:42.961 --> 00:03:45.660
- ...noodles.
- Noodles?
…面条

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.053
You were really
dreaming about noodles?
面条？你真的梦到面条？

00:03:48.184 --> 00:03:50.795
Uh... yeah. What else
would I be dreaming about?
是啊 要不然咧？

00:03:50.926 --> 00:03:53.407
Oh! Careful!
That soup is sharp.
小心汤面上面的…飞镖

00:03:53.537 --> 00:03:59.195
Oh, happy day! My son, finally
having the noodle dream!
我儿子终于梦到面条了！

00:03:59.326 --> 00:04:04.244
You don't know how long I've
been waiting for this moment.
你不知道这一刻我等了多久

00:04:04.374 --> 00:04:07.943
- This is a sign, Po.
- A sign of what?
这是个好征兆 阿波！

00:04:08.073 --> 00:04:11.033
You are almost ready
to be entrusted
你就快要可以继承…

00:04:11.163 --> 00:04:15.167
with the secret ingredient
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.
…我的祖传秘方煲汤的祖传秘方

00:04:15.298 --> 00:04:17.822
And then you will
fulfill your destiny
然后你就能接掌这家面店

00:04:17.953 --> 00:04:20.303
and take over
the restaurant!
然后你就能接掌这家面店

00:04:20.434 --> 00:04:22.044
Just as I took it over
from my father,
就像我从我老爸那里接掌…
他从他老爸那里接掌的面店

00:04:22.174 --> 00:04:24.046
who took it over
from his father...
就像我从我老爸那里接掌…
他从他老爸那里接掌的面店

00:04:24.176 --> 00:04:26.701
...who won it
from a friend in mahjong.
只不过这是他老爸
打麻将赢来的

00:04:26.831 --> 00:04:31.619
- Dad, Dad, Dad,
it was just a dream.
- No, it was the dream.
老爸 那只是一场梦

00:04:31.749 --> 00:04:35.362
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs through our veins.
面店老板就连血都流着面汤

00:04:35.492 --> 00:04:39.322
But, Dad, didn't you ever
want to do something else?
老爸 你有想过做别的事吗？

00:04:39.453 --> 00:04:41.324
Something besides noodles?
除了面条以外…

00:04:41.455 --> 00:04:44.284
Actually, when I was
young and crazy,
事实上 当我年少轻狂时

00:04:44.414 --> 00:04:48.462
I thought about running away
and learning how to make tofu.
我曾考虑逃跑去学做豆腐

00:04:48.592 --> 00:04:49.680
So why didn't you?
那你怎么没这样做呢？

00:04:49.811 --> 00:04:51.639
Because it was a stupid dream.
喔 那只是一个愚蠢的梦想

00:04:51.769 --> 00:04:54.990
Can you imagine
me making tofu?
你能想像我做豆腐的样子吗？

00:04:55.120 --> 00:04:58.254
[laughing] Tofu.
哈…做豆腐…

00:04:58.385 --> 00:05:01.692
No! We all have
our place in this world.
不 每个人都有安身立足之处

00:05:01.823 --> 00:05:04.304
Mine is here,
and yours is...
我的是这里
而你的是…

00:05:04.434 --> 00:05:05.696
I know, is here.
我知道 这里

00:05:05.827 --> 00:05:08.873
No, it's at tables
2, 5, 7, and 12
不 还有外场！

00:05:09.004 --> 00:05:10.919
Service with a smile.
上菜时要微笑

00:05:11.049 --> 00:05:15.880
[gong sounding]

00:05:16.011 --> 00:05:19.406
[flute playing]

